WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:01.540
Hello Pongfinity!

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:03.660
Hello, hello!

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:05.520
Hello everybody!

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:06.880
We are Pongfinity

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:10.800
Welcome to a new episode of Challenge Pongfinity

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.900
In this series you challenge us

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:15.620
with your crazy table tennis ideas

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:20.080
We have separated the table

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.360
We have one half here and the other 5 meters away

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:37.880
Good one!

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:58.220
That was quite low! Pretty good!

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.700
It's time to play with the chair.

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:41.500
The table is this way.

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:42.860
I thought it was that way.

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:54.420
I wasn't sure which way to have the chair!

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:33.200
It's not possible to hit so hard like this.

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:35.560
I won!

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:41.140
Now let's do one shot which each of the chair legs.

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:54.640
Just when I got them all!

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:56.980
Let's try the Xu Xin ball catch

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.440
With a non-chinese rubber.

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:09.300
It's okay.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:12.780
There were a few bounces, it was not perfect.

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:14.580
We can do better!

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:24.060
There we have it!

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:25.780
The Xu Xin ball catch.

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:31.100
Yes.

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:32.600
Perfect catch.

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:36.180
With a wooden blade this should be a bit more difficult.

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:45.980
Not too bad.

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:48.300
Thanks for watching everybody!

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:49.640
Remember to subscribe here.

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:51.460
And watch our previous videos there.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:52.800
Until next time!

